e are buttons.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644200/extras/0acb5aff12cede07851a32e368ef9793.poster.avif?t=1681324993\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644200/extras/0acb5aff12cede07851a32e368ef9793.webm?t=1681324993\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1644200/extras/0acb5aff12cede07851a32e368ef9793.mp4?t=1681324993\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong> Plot </strong> </h2><br>Not provided, for that there is a variety of funny voice acting for characters and videos.<br><br>-If there is no plot, then why go through the game at all?<br>-At the end you will be shown a cartoon. The final scene is definitely worth trying to beat the game.",
